["Item-140262"] = {
["Text"] = {
["enUS"] = {
{
["Page"] = 1,
["Text"] = "FOR SALE: EZ-123 BUNKER BUILDER\r\n\r\nThe end is approaching, but you and your loved ones can survive with your very own B.B.! The Bunker Builder is the latest in gnomish engineering. Simple to operate, small enough for a mountain ram to carry, the B.B. can deploy in almost any terrain (see disclaimers). With the press of a button, the device will tunnel deep underground and hollow out a cozy cavern where you can live in peace. Each purchase comes with two air fresheners, a rope ladder (see disclaimers), and an operator's manual.\r\n\r\nDisclaimers: Not for use in sand, water, or Dalaran. Deploy rope ladder BEFORE entering the B.B. tunnel.",
},
},
},
["Title"] = {
["enUS"] = "Tattered Pamphlet",
},
["Source"] = {
["ID"] = 140262,
["Type"] = "Item",
},
},
["Item-16263"] = {
["Text"] = {
["enUS"] = {
{
["Page"] = 1,
["Text"] = "Nyoma,\r\n\r\nYou can't imagine how surprised I was to receive the recipe book! Everything you included is just as I remember from home. I can't wait to try out the new recipes.\r\n\r\nWhen you have some time, you should come visit me in Darnassus. I'll even cook for you!\r\n\r\nYour friend,\r\nAquinne",
},
},
},
["Title"] = {
["enUS"] = "Sister Aquinne's Note",
},
["Source"] = {
["ID"] = 16263,
["Type"] = "Item",
},
},
["Item-151761"] = {
["Text"] = {
["enUS"] = {
{
["Page"] = 1,
["Text"] = "kill the dragon\r\nkill the dragon\r\nkill the\r\n  DRAGON\r\n\r\nit's not a gnome, it's a DRAGON\r\n\r\nnot even a good dragon\r\n\r\nSLAY THE DRAGON\r\n\r\ncrossed the timeways one too many times, didn't you? made a few enemies? maybe caused a paradox you couldn't reconcile?\r\n\r\nthe demons, the elementals, the humans and orcs... they're all on MY SIDE NOT YOURS\r\n\r\nNOW YOU'VE GONE AND DONE IT, WHELP",
},
},
},
["Title"] = {
["enUS"] = "Scribbled Ravings",
},
["Source"] = {
["ID"] = 151761,
["Type"] = "Item",
},
},
["GameObject-653515"] = {
["Text"] = {
["enUS"] = {
{
["Page"] = 1,
["Text"] = "THE WORDS OF TALL KANU'YE, MEANT FOR YAN'TI THE BOLD\r\n\r\nTHE WALLS GROW HIGHER AND HIGHER AND SOON THE SUN WILL SHINE UPON HER NO MORE\r\n\r\nTHIS SPACE FOR THOSE WHO GUARD HER IN LIFE AND DEATH\r\n\r\nTHE SIGHT OF THIS STONE PRISON MUST INSPIRE FEAR AND WONDER IN THOSE WHO LOOK UPON IT EQUAL TO THOSE WHO LAID EYES UPON HER\r\n\r\nIT IS AGREED THAT THE IMAGE OF THE SNAKE AND GREEN OF HER VENOM WARNS THAT NO HONOR CAN BE FOUND HERE\r\n\r\nTHE BUILDERS STRIP THE DEAD SOULCOILERS OF THEIR BRONZE\r\n\r\nLET ROBBERS FIND THEM NAKED AND BARE OF TREASURES\r\n\r\nWHILE WE NEAR THE TASK'S END, I MUST REPORT THE QUALITY OF STONE HAS DEGRADED\r\n\r\nOUR MASONS HAVE GIVEN COMPLAINTS AND WE STRUGGLE TO QUELL FIGHTS AMONG THEM\r\n\r\nTHEY ARE WITHOUT REST AND AFTER SEVEN AND TEN SEASONS ONLY HOME WILL BRING THEM PEACE\r\n\r\nWE DARE NOT MAKE THE MOUNTAIN ITSELF OUR QUARRY AND WE MUST NOT TRADE IN QUANTITIES THAT EXPOSES OUR SHAME\r\n\r\nI ASK WE SEARCH WEST FOR GOOD STONE\r\n\r\n-TALL KANU'YE",
},
},
},
["Title"] = {
["enUS"] = "Head Mason's Tablet",
},
["Source"] = {
["ID"] = 653515,
["Type"] = "GameObject",
},
},
["GameObject-557910"] = {
["Text"] = {
["enUS"] = {
{
["Page"] = 1,
["Text"] = "<HTML><BODY>\r\n<H1 align=\"center\">Aln'hara's Bloom</H1>\r\n<HR/>\r\n<P>\r\nA woven vessel of vine and bark cradles a single radiant flower. Its petals shimmer with a soft, living glow. When held close, a faint hum like distant singing can be heard.\r\n<BR/><BR/>\r\nIt is said this bloom carries an echo of the goddess--a piece of the song that first called the haranir to Harandar.\r\n</P>\r\n</BODY></HTML>",
},
},
},
["Title"] = {
["enUS"] = "Aln'hara's Bloom",
},
["Source"] = {
["ID"] = 557910,
["Type"] = "GameObject",
},
},
["GameObject-669308"] = {
["Text"] = {
["enUS"] = {
{
["Page"] = 1,
["Text"] = "CURSE THE AMANI\r\nCURSE THE PRIESTS\r\nCURSE THE WARRIORS\r\nWE ARE ABANDONED\r\n\r\nTHE MASONS THE LABORERS\r\nWE ARE THE SACRIFICE\r\nTO ENSURE AMANI SAFETY\r\nWE ARE ABANDONED TO THE MIST\r\n\r\nNO GLORY AWAITS US\r\nONLY FANGS\r\nONLY DEATH",
},
{
["Page"] = 2,
["Text"] = "WE DID NOT CHOOSE THIS FATE\r\nTHE MISTS CLOSED IN\r\nTHE PRIESTS KNEW\r\nTHE PRIESTS KEEP SECRETS\r\n\r\nWE WILL NOT SURVIVE\r\nI CARVE MY LAST WORDS\r\nI EXISTED \r\nI WAS BETRAYED\r\nFROM MY SWEAT AND SACRIFICE\r\nTHE PRIESTS LIVE AND I WILL NOT \r\n\r\n- TAN'ZEK THE ABANDONED",
},
},
},
["Title"] = {
["enUS"] = "Abandoned Tablet",
},
["Source"] = {
["ID"] = 669308,
["Type"] = "GameObject",
},
},
["GameObject-668598"] = {
["Text"] = {
["enUS"] = {
{
["Page"] = 1,
["Text"] = "To my father: I will sing the songs you taught me, but I cannot remember the words. I hope you will teach me again someday.",
},
},
},
["Title"] = {
["enUS"] = "Funerary Inscription",
},
["Source"] = {
["ID"] = 668598,
["Type"] = "GameObject",
},
},
["GameObject-252387"] = {
["Text"] = {
["enUS"] = {
{
["Page"] = 1,
["Text"] = "I should have admired Illidan from the beginning. After all, he saved my father's life.\r\n\r\nIt happened during a mission that Kur'talos took into the wilds beyond Black Rook Hold. I was not there to witness it, but it was reported that one of the Legion's ravenous felhunter demons attacked and disarmed my father. The beast would have devoured him if Illidan had not intervened. With his quick thinking and mastery of the arcane, the Stormrage twin defeated the demon and spared my father a grim end.\r\n\r\nRather than downplay this event, my father celebrated it. He named Illidan his personal sorcerer, and young Stormrage became the talk of the resistance. Moon Guard members clamored for an audience with him to discuss his thoughts on the war, the nature of demons, and the arcane arts. Before long, Illidan had gained a reputation as a sorcerer without equal.",
},
{
["Page"] = 2,
["Text"] = "From that day forward, Illidan fought by my father's side in battle. I watched him like a storm crow, determined to learn more about this strange new member of my family's inner circle. \r\n\r\nWhat I discovered did not put my heart at ease. Far from it.",
},
},
},
["Title"] = {
["enUS"] = "Dog-Eared Page",
},
["Source"] = {
["ID"] = 252387,
["Type"] = "GameObject",
},
},
["Item-20010"] = {
["Text"] = {
["enUS"] = {
{
["Page"] = 1,
["Text"] = "His name will not die.\nHis sacrifice will always\nserve to show the way.\n\nShackles once that choked\nthe inhale of honor's breath\nno longer bind us.",
},
{
["Page"] = 2,
["Text"] = "Can you hear his scream?\nA battle wail for the Horde:\nVictory or death!\n\nWe must remember\nhis strength in the face of death.\nHis dream, now made real.",
},
{
["Page"] = 3,
["Text"] = "Dangers everywhere!\nEnemies seek to bring us\nback to the shackles.\n\nWhen we fight, think of\nhe who did what must be done.\nHellscream, forever!",
},
},
},
["Title"] = {
["enUS"] = "The Horde's Hellscream",
},
["Source"] = {
["ID"] = 20010,
["Type"] = "Item",
},
},
},
["Creature"] = {
[237433] = {
["BroadcastText"] = {
["enUS"] = {
["My patience is at its end. If the Amani cannot handle this threat, then the sin'dorei will."] = true,
["Despite our long history of animosity, we elves have proven that together we are greater than our grievances."] = true,
["Look here! He left his weapon behind."] = true,
["Lady Liadrin, secure the pass. For good or ill, we've taken a stand here. We should keep it."] = true,
["We believe we can heal the Darkwell, and we would like you there when we do."] = true,
["To death where you belong."] = true,
["I know this is no small thing you offer us. Silvermoon owes you a debt of gratitude."] = true,
["Likewise. Sylvanas and I have both sent ships to support Vol'jin's revolution."] = true,
["A giant creature affected by the Lightbloom is dangerously close to my people. Give it a merciful death."] = true,
["The rest of us will return to Silvermoon. There is... much to discuss."] = true,
["Vereesa Windrunner. I had not believed you would ever return to this city, but I welcome your help."] = true,
["The kaldorei forces make this fight possible, but we will need more allies to be assured of victory."] = true,
["This means he's completely unhinged."] = true,
["If Fairbreeze is safe--the Voidstorm still looms."] = true,
["Were we blind to Arator's truth?"] = true,
["Champion, you've uncovered many threats that besiege Quel'Thalas. We must plan our next move together."] = true,
["Halduron has joined your haranir friend to aid in ending the threat. They await you in Fairbreeze."] = true,
["Move forward! In the name of Quel'Thalas!"] = true,
["It is always a pleasure to see you, Lady Proudmoore."] = true,
["The Vanguard of the Light prepares to assault the Voidspire. They await your arrival, champion. Join them. Show Xal'atath the fury of Azeroth."] = true,
["Perhaps the rifts between us will never fully heal. But we must at least attempt to bridge them."] = true,
["Turalyon, how does our army fare?"] = true,
["Lady Liadrin is in Zul'Aman now, looking into the situation. She'll need backup."] = true,
["Umbric. Something has changed in Arator. What happened out there?"] = true,
["They're trying to free Kith'ix. We must stop them, but they are not going to make it easy for us."] = true,
["This is no time for diplomacy. We must strike before the aqir attack again."] = true,
["Defenders of Silvermoon! Give these monsters no quarter!"] = true,
["But Arator is a paladin of the Light. How could he do that without causing a violent reaction?"] = true,
["With what army, Arator? The Vanguard is gone."] = true,
["Perhaps one day we'll truly reach an accord with the Amani and no more blood will need to be shed."] = true,
["Liadrin and I have much to discuss. Please give my regards to Umbric... and to Arator."] = true,
["I trust--and hope--that things went well, $PLAYER_NAME$."] = true,
["Bishop Alonsus Faol has a plan to support those at the Sunwell. And to help Arator."] = true,
["Advance! Let nothing through!"] = true,
["I am. Her final journey should be at your side."] = true,
["The Sunwell has fallen. Xal'atath has twisted its power to the Void, creating the Darkwell."] = true,
["Then the aqir or their barrier cannot stand. I'll defer to our axe-swinging hash'ey to clear the path."] = true,
["We can't defend against both the Voidstorm and the aggression from the Lightbloom."] = true,
["The Amani's recklessness has placed us all in danger. I should have sent troops into Zul'Aman."] = true,
["Champion! Our troops are ready to assist. Signal them when needed."] = true,
["With the shal'dorei, we have gathered together more elves in one place than we have seen in ages."] = true,
["The Sunwell can only be empowered for so long. Those who are maintaining its current state are under immense strain."] = true,
["What would you have me do? Kith'ix must die, no matter the consequence."] = true,
["We have them on the run! Let this Devouring Host know the fury of Quel'Thalas!"] = true,
["The Amani are to blame for this! Muster our forces. We'll march through Zul'Aman and end Kith'ix once and for all."] = true,
["Seek out Umbric in Tranquillien. Reach out when you have more to share."] = true,
["The rebel Amani here lash out at Silvermoon instead of the threats at large. They are no longer protected by their kinsman's treaty."] = true,
["Then you leave me no choice."] = true,
["Kith'ix will fall to the might of Silvermoon!"] = true,
["Silvermoon will not fall to the likes of you!"] = true,
["The Amani crossed a line. We need to make sure their encroachment has ended."] = true,
["Let us hope that remains to be true. I've seen what happens when those two forces collide. There is a reason Turalyon and Alleria so often drift apart."] = true,
["Take all the time you need, Zul'jarra. When you are ready, come to Silvermoon. Bring her home to us. Please."] = true,
["We will finish what the Amani started!"] = true,
["Zul'jarra, Liadrin is right. We cannot allow the scars of our past to rob us all of our future."] = true,
["The conflict between the blood elves and the high elves of the Silver Covenant is still fresh. I foresee problems on both sides."] = true,
["I sent Lady Liadrin to inform the Vanguard's commanders that they may deploy at once, and leave our city in peace."] = true,
["The Sunwell holds for now, only through the constant effort of its defenders. Should their strength waver..."] = true,
["It would be an honor. We will join you as soon as we can."] = true,
["I have received word from Magister Umbric. The way to the Voidstorm is clear!"] = true,
["The aqir stir now that Kith'ix wakens. We must stop them from spreading destruction on its behalf."] = true,
},
},
