[235393] = {
["BroadcastText"] = {
["enUS"] = {
["$PLAYER_NAME$, find Umbric. I'll keep guard here."] = true,
["It will have to be. We are fighting for the safety of our world."] = true,
["The dark power pouring out of the Sunwell... I can feel it even from here."] = true,
["Oh, $PLAYER_NAME$. You're here. Good. I need your help."] = true,
["Ugh! It looks--and smells--like the local pets were marking their territory. They're obviously distressed."] = true,
["The Void... mother says it speaks to you. To Belo'ren, we are attacking what he was sworn to defend."] = true,
["Champions! Prepare yourselves!"] = true,
["I don't understand how it happened."] = true,
["A notebook? So many pages missing... strange. Let's get to Umbric. He'll want to know."] = true,
["Orweyna... what was that thing?"] = true,
["You live up to your legend, mother."] = true,
["I was about to say the same to you."] = true,
["This bush was trampled--the poor wildlife here must be terrified."] = true,
["Champion, if you would meet us at the gates it would be a powerful symbol."] = true,
["Do you think returning Anasterian's relics will convince those like Aethas to allow you to return?"] = true,
["$PLAYER_NAME$, hang in there!"] = true,
["ATTACK!"] = true,
["We must retake and cleanse the Sunwell. This will require all the elven people to set aside our differences, and fight together."] = true,
["Elves of Azeroth! The Devouring Host has come to consume our homes, our lives, and our families."] = true,
["Push through the swarms! We have to reach Lor'themar!"] = true,
["You'll burn only yourself! You can come back from this!"] = true,
["I know what the Void can do. I can handle this."] = true,
["This nest... it's being choked by the Lightbloom growth. Let's fix this."] = true,
["The Twilight's Blade have seized the docks. We must deal with them first before we assault the span."] = true,
["Liadrin. With all that's happened, we haven't had much time to talk."] = true,
["Elves of Azeroth! With me! One final push to the Sunwell!"] = true,
["Champions! You face Belo'ren while we get this barrier down!"] = true,
["Is that fear in your voice, Xal'atath? We aren't going anywhere."] = true,
["What are you doing to her?!"] = true,
["Light soothe those wounds, little friend."] = true,
["Thalyssra and Vereesa are in position."] = true,
["They stood with us while others fled. You owe them more than suspicion."] = true,
["The nearest Lightbloom is nowhere near the village. How did the growth get all the way out here?"] = true,
["If I've learned anything from this place, it's that the Devouring Host is eager to prey upon our convictions."] = true,
["That's everyone except for the shal'dorei. Any word, First Arcanist?"] = true,
["Mother!"] = true,
["Kith'ix has to be dealt with. But if Lor'themar isn't careful, he'll just be trading one crisis for another."] = true,
["The Void gathers in great strength over here. We would be wise to disrupt them."] = true,
["What a stench! It's secreting some sort of pheromone..."] = true,
["Trouble ahead! On your guard!"] = true,
["Mother said you're familiar with the wilds. What do you make of all this?"] = true,
["I will not stand by as that cult takes this town!"] = true,
["Stand fast. The Void's hunger must not claim any more of our people."] = true,
["Heal as quickly as you can. Regroup at Muster Point! $PLAYER_NAME$, defend them!"] = true,
["That sounds like Kasiea. I wonder if she left anything behind? Let's go see."] = true,
["Now is the time! Signal Thalyssra to open fire!"] = true,
["We all stray, sometimes. What's important is finding our way back."] = true,
["That creature must have come from the Lightbloom! We should let the Magistrix know."] = true,
["All these poor souls were peeled off from their units. We should stay together."] = true,
["No need to mourn--he'll return anew."] = true,
["Their forces are seemingly endless. Fear not, $PLAYER_NAME$. There will be a dawn yet."] = true,
["Advance! Give these voidspawn no quarter!"] = true,
["I hope that these relics of Anasterian are enough to remind Silvermoon that we are still one people."] = true,
["Do you hear that? The aqir are in the city!"] = true,
["I won't let that happen. Go, check on your people--I need to tell Silvermoon what's happened here. I'll catch up with you."] = true,
["All is not lost, Umbric. They can't have stolen everything."] = true,
["This army will see you vanquished, Xal'atath. I swear it on my father's shield."] = true,
["No!"] = true,
["This isn't right. See what's in that lockbox she was toying with."] = true,
["Rescue any civilians you can and get to the front gates. I'll rally the city guard!"] = true,
["The Lightbloom first appeared when the Sunwell was restored, many years ago. But it never grew near civilization like this."] = true,
["Vereesa will provide support from the skies and Thalyssra from the sea."] = true,
["That's not much of an answer. Hm."] = true,
["Two halves of a whole--Vereesa, follow the Light phoenix. I'll take the other side."] = true,
["We need to get out there and help those still on the battlefield."] = true,
["Heal within the protection of my Light! We will defend you!"] = true,
["These aqir came out of nowhere. Were they slumbering beneath Eversong all this time?"] = true,
["We've made it across the bridge, but the true battle lies ahead. Be ready for the worst, $PLAYER_NAME$."] = true,
["... Just a bunch of stubborn old elves!"] = true,
["We need to report back to Silvermoon. They need to know about this."] = true,
["Aethas, be courageous enough to unify our people as Anasterian did, in defiance of this invasion."] = true,
["They shouldn't be a problem much longer."] = true,
["I read about this type of aqir. The smell is meant to direct a swarm to its location!"] = true,
["There we are--keep him close now!"] = true,
["We can't leave it like this--the wounds the Void left behind must be healed."] = true,
["The Light will prevail. We must have faith."] = true,
["Go! I will hold back the aqir. Come back safe, please. All of you!"] = true,
["The only one who will burn today is you."] = true,
["The others have gathered gifts from their home to help with the Darkwell. Please let them know we are ready for them."] = true,
["May the Light bless the fallen and safeguard the living as we hold back this evil from our world."] = true,
["A lack of Farstriders seems very convenient for our murderer."] = true,
["Champion! Now that the skies are clear, fly to me at the bridge. It is time to advance to Quel'Danas!"] = true,
["Quickly now! Bring him down before they hatch anew!"] = true,
["Let's split up. We can cover more ground. I'll meet up with the two of you later."] = true,
["Hold, $PLAYER_NAME$. There's a body here. What's that clutched in her hand?"] = true,
["$PLAYER_NAME$, wait! It's an ambush!"] = true,
["Too many people are dodging questions... There may be something darker going on here."] = true,
["Thank you for all you've done, $PLAYER_NAME$. For the Vanguard, for Silvermoon... and for me."] = true,
["You're safe! Have you seen Umbric?"] = true,
["I thought the Lightbloom could aid the Vanguard... but were they the ones to cause this?"] = true,
["What happened here?"] = true,
["Taking the span was just the first step. Now we must face Xal'atath before this Darkwell corrupts all of Azeroth."] = true,
["A cult? ...could it be the Twilight's Blade, here?"] = true,
["When the attacks first started, you went to the Sunwell and prayed for a miracle. Heroes from all over the world appeared in a flash of light--just in time to save the city."] = true,
["N-no... liar!"] = true,
["Hold the line! This ends now!"] = true,
["Perhaps this sudden growth is tied to the empowerment of the Sunwell. I think I was right--this could be used to help the Vanguard."] = true,
["The aqir are relentless. This won't end until we find a way to stop Kith'ix."] = true,
["The rest of us will pierce the enemy's line and secure the harbor. $PLAYER_NAME$, with me!"] = true,
["It was no trouble at all."] = true,
["Could the voice you heard have been the Worldsoul we've heard about? Could it have reached out through the Light?"] = true,
["$PLAYER_NAME$, a word. I ask that you not mention anything to my mother about what happened at the Amani Pass."] = true,
["Like the Radiant Song?"] = true,
["The Nightborne have yet to answer the missive? Could it have been lost in transit?"] = true,
["We will not let them take anyone else! Not one more. Today, we break the Void!"] = true,
["Wait, is that Everdawn? She went missing soon after we entered the Voidstorm."] = true,
["There's more to be done, but I think we've earned a moment of respite. Let's head back to Silvermoon for now."] = true,
["The Vanguard has rushed out full of conviction, and its soldiers return here to the infirmary."] = true,
["This could be just what Xal'atath wants. Mother, father... be careful."] = true,
},
