},
[239522] = {
["BroadcastText"] = {
["enUS"] = {
["Though we haranir have traveled far and wide, it was always in shadow and secrecy."] = true,
["What brings you here? Did you hear the...? Hmm."] = true,
["Lor'themar still sees threats in every shadow. The Amani need not be his enemy any longer."] = true,
["Wait... the venom stopped but the door is still closed."] = true,
["Follow the trail. It should lead to the answers we seek."] = true,
["Worshippers? What became of them?"] = true,
["One full belly, and a few pleased elders. Well done my friend."] = true,
["The glory should have been mine..."] = true,
["These vicious rutaani have overgrown Blooming Lattice. Prune them back."] = true,
["Brann is very interested in my homeland, and I'm certain he will be impressed."] = true,
["Ula'tek's prison is open. We must deal with her before she escapes."] = true,
["Zul'jarra does not have much time. I'll scout ahead, bring down the barriers, $PLAYER_NAME$!"] = true,
["$PLAYER_NAME$, we must discover what caused these creatures to flourish so suddenly."] = true,
["We must be careful. Untold horrors could be waking in the temple."] = true,
["And summoned a creature from a place none should disturb: the Rift of Aln."] = true,
["Her again. Nek'zali. We must witness the rest of this vision together."] = true,
["A rutaani. Creatures from my homeland. They should not be here."] = true,
["I'll return to the shadows. The temple is ahead."] = true,
["None were successful in consuming this one."] = true,
["A rutaani, here? What is that it holds?"] = true,
["Elder Hagar has called on the elven leaders to join this gathering in Harandar. It is of great importance."] = true,
["I don't know. We need to tell him while he can still undo it."] = true,
["The roots coil and slither at my command. Oh, I like this body."] = true,
["I hope we're not too late."] = true,
["I was hesitant when the time came to show ourselves to the other peoples of this world. Should such traditions be broken?"] = true,
["Ula'tek."] = true,
["I can sense the spirits of the Soulcoilers' victims on the ledges above. Perhaps we should investigate."] = true,
["It seems even your runestones cannot stop the Lightbloom surge, if there are none left to defend them."] = true,
["Alndust is limited, so we must cull the areas where the Lightbloom is most active."] = true,
["Ula'tek's influence here is overwhelming. Dark acts have stained this place."] = true,
["Magistrix, when did you first begin seeing these disturbances with this Lightbloom?"] = true,
["The Lightbloom kills, then grows anew. A vicious cycle that cannot be allowed to continue."] = true,
["A mother is always near her brood. If we could announce we are near her eggs."] = true,
["Brann asked to have you document the creatures of Harandar. You can borrow this beast to travel swiftly."] = true,
["This Lightbloom you describe is clearly out of control. We must find what has disturbed it so."] = true,
["Hopefully that will keep them from spilling out further and threatening other areas."] = true,
["The Lightbloom is persistent--we too must be."] = true,
["They did what was right."] = true,
["They even consume each other when given the chance."] = true,
["I stand with you!"] = true,
["A large attack only causes the Lightbloom to spread. A few, striking the most dangerous--that is best."] = true,
["The rutaani... they are being driven to grow. This Light you speak of may be the cause."] = true,
["The Den has been ravaged with vermin. If we deal with that problem the elders will be more favorable with us. Take a grymlinx--they are always up for a meal."] = true,
["The Children of Ula'tek infuse these eggs with her venom to transform them into these abominations."] = true,
["Your sister--"] = true,
["I will search for the outlander."] = true,
["The song of the goddess! But it is... pained, somehow."] = true,
["You will not sacrifice us!"] = true,
["The creatures... they remind me of home, yet they live on the surface. It should not be this way."] = true,
["The defenders of the Vale are growing weary. Use this rejuvenation pollen to revive them."] = true,
["The dagger, the sacrifices... I know what afflicts Zul'jarra!"] = true,
["But they should be safe until after your initiation ceremony."] = true,
["I can feel Kith'ix's evil stirring below us. He is here."] = true,
["The trolls would have lost but a few took a desperate risk."] = true,
["There is a dark presence. One I know well. Nek'zali--the one who raised Ula'tek--is here!"] = true,
["Orweyna? You speak to Nek'zali now. Kneel and I'll let you live."] = true,
["The paintings speak differently for each of us."] = true,
["They called it..."] = true,
["Well done. They will carry on their duties with renewed vigor."] = true,
["We will find the answers we seek here. The goddess wills it."] = true,
["This is wrong. All wrong."] = true,
["They do not understand the dangers of Harandar. We must find them."] = true,
["But not you, Amani."] = true,
["They sought the most powerful presence they could find... and pulled."] = true,
["But you have proven it was a worthy stride. We now know not only the lands of Aln'hara, but her peoples, her cultures, too. And they know us in kind."] = true,
["The beast finally met its match."] = true,
["He must mean the priestess from the memories we saw before."] = true,
["They were losing. Did they not know Ula'tek was coming?"] = true,
["The growth of these plants has been forced. By what, I do not know."] = true,
["$PLAYER_NAME$ will find them. We must get you to safety."] = true,
["The Rift of Aln is a place of madness and pain, but the Amani found something greater."] = true,
["We have solved nothing. These rutaani have been changed. I must return to Harandar and investigate."] = true,
["That doesn't matter now. You need help."] = true,
["Ula'tek's influence is evolving these creatures."] = true,
["Ah yes, journeys, it is time for you to go home."] = true,
["This is an outsider's war gear. Without it they could be easy prey, even for small predators. That's concerning."] = true,
["This is Aln'hara's greatest gift: the lives we all share. So go forth and continue your travels with Aln'hara's grace in your every step. Thank you, $PLAYER_NAME$."] = true,
["$PLAYER_NAME$, I must speak with you. When you are done here, come to me at the docks."] = true,
["Shed your skin."] = true,
["All these eggs... But where is Ula'tek? We can't let her or her brood escape and poison our world."] = true,
["There's a path to the altar through these snake tunnels. Come with me."] = true,
["She is gone. Ula'tek's corruption no longer threatens Azeroth."] = true,
["The land can heal once more--and so can the Amani."] = true,
["This is no venom, but a curse! The same one that summoned Ula'tek!"] = true,
},
},
["Name"] = {
["enUS"] = "Orweyna",
},
},
