[241650] = {
["BroadcastText"] = {
["enUS"] = {
["Catalogue every newcomer. I want no secrets among these latest arrivals."] = true,
["The Lightbloom is still an ever-present threat."] = true,
["That desk was a menace. It kept eating magic items we left on it."] = true,
["Knowledge is our first defense. You've strengthened our walls today... Efficiently done."] = true,
["Silvermoon's students have unique ways of studying the arcane. Perhaps you could learn a thing or two."] = true,
["Your... contact has been investigating the overgrowth. Perhaps she has found something of value."] = true,
["Perhaps our students should do it themselves next time... Regardless, your efforts suffice. For now."] = true,
["See what the sommeliers have for my collection. Take extra care. This is no trivial matter."] = true,
["Our training grounds are riddled with pests! Your... years of experience should allow you to swiftly handle this matter."] = true,
["Silvermoon thrives through fresh talent. Recruit any who seem capable."] = true,
["Next time they shall think twice before sullying our shores with their filth."] = true,
["Smugglers have no place in Eversong. Let the ashes of their shipments deliver the message."] = true,
["Well... a lot of work went into it and you did earn it."] = true,
["The magic of Quel'Thalas belongs to the sin'dorei. Remind these snakes they are no longer welcome here."] = true,
["To show our gratitude for your aid, we... I... am awarding you this property as an embassy for the ren'dorei."] = true,
["You have much to learn, but that was a surprisingly good showing."] = true,
["Hmm... Your palate is more sophisticated than I thought. I look forward to enjoying a glass... or two."] = true,
["Pathetic. Scrounging for the scraps of their betters. How far they have fallen."] = true,
["Let's get this over with. Umbric, in light of all you have done for Silvermoon, I hereby return your research materials."] = true,
