[229476] = {
["BroadcastText"] = {
["enUS"] = {
["Look here! It's the history of Zian of the Endless Shadow, a powerful sorcerer who kept the kingdoms in check through terror and darkness."] = true,
["These discs look familiar, but I cannot place their origin."] = true,
["After his father died, Thassarian followed in his footsteps and joined Lordaeron's military."] = true,
["Well then, I hope I can do this tale justice."] = true,
["Such a foul, foul thing - destroy it, before it seeps deep into the soil and corrupts all of Pandaria!"] = true,
["It will take much time for the Vale to heal, but you have given us hope!"] = true,
["I fear that our war against our ancient enemies is still far from over."] = true,
["The evil slumbered for a millennium, but then stirred once again. The Horde and Alliance had to put aside their animosity to face this threat."] = true,
["And let's hear it for the heroes of the Scarab Wall!"] = true,
["I...I see everything clearly now."] = true,
["Well! I've had my fill of food for now, but I can never have enough stories. Who will tell the next tale?"] = true,
["Astounding! Another chamber that looks to originate from these \"Titans.\""] = true,
["Ah, you have done it!  The waters are pure once more."] = true,
["Feng the Accursed was betrayed by four emperors of the mogu, his body destroyed each time, only to rise again."] = true,
["Right, right! C'Thun. A name so unspeakable that I forgot how to say it!"] = true,
["In the chamber ahead, under our peaceful land, slept the heart of an Old God."] = true,
["Astounding! An actual, functional Mogu construct machine."] = true,
["It is done, then. Yet...how many of these machines are hidden beneath the earth? How much do we not know about the dark secrets of the mogu?"] = true,
["We seem to have awakened a spirit of some kind."] = true,
["Warriors of the Horde, make some noise!"] = true,
["The ancient vaults of the mogu, untouched by time for thousands of years, who knows what secrets await?"] = true,
["It is these waters that kept the Vale in bloom.  Their runoff into the Valley of the Four Winds created the most fertile farmland in the world!"] = true,
["Under the new banner of the Might of Kalimdor, they prepared to break the magic that contained the qiraji."] = true,
["We must go, we are not done yet."] = true,
["Show C'Thun what we think of it. Get out of here you giant creepy artichoke!"] = true,
["The machine has been destroyed, and so the mogu's power weakens."] = true,
["The land is scarred, the ever-blooming trees and plants wither and die as the water from the pools drains away."] = true,
["This place, this festival--I hope you realize just how special it is, Li Li."] = true,
["To the fallen, we salute you!"] = true,
["Once, the Titans used these life-giving waters to create and shape all life in Pandaria."] = true,
["Don't speak, friend, I will take you to the healers."] = true,
["And now, the malignance of the Old God has manifested itself within the waters."] = true,
["Ah, we adventure together again, except this time I am afraid that the circumstances are much more dire."] = true,
["Oh my!  What is this?  Hello!  I am Lorewalker Cho!"] = true,
["We cannot allow this to fall into the wrong hands."] = true,
["The Zandalari, ancient allies of the mogu! They must seek the legendary weapon within the depths of the Vaults!"] = true,
["Can it be...? Oh no, no no no no no."] = true,
["I will find help!  Try to hold off the Sha for as long as you can!"] = true,
["Further corruption?  No, we are here to stop the corruption, and save Pandaria!"] = true,
["Now, raise a glass with me. Honor the fallen and never forget their sacrifice."] = true,
["I feel as if I am living a dream."] = true,
["Look at the dust along the floor, these dark halls have not seen footfalls for many centuries."] = true,
["The Golden Lotus... they pledged their lives to defend this place."] = true,
["We have disturbed what should not have been disturbed. He cannot be free to escape this prison! You must destroy him!"] = true,
["Heroes fought their way into the temple, destroying its guardians one after another."] = true,
["Finally, in the heart of the temple, they faced the Old God... um... What was the name again?"] = true,
["I hear a faint humming. It is coming from this direction!"] = true,
["Defenders of the Alliance, let me hear you!"] = true,
["The battle was terrible, but our champions prevailed. This marked our first victory against the Old Gods. Though not our last..."] = true,
["I am sorry I did not tell you earlier! These vaults house a weapon of unimaginable power! Stop them!"] = true,
["Great heroes gathered at the Scarab Wall. The time for battle drew near, looming over everyone like a cresting wave."] = true,
["Can you feel their life-giving energies flow through you?"] = true,
["The Titans! It would seem the mogu salvaged and repurposed ancient Titan technology to advance their empire!"] = true,
["So the stories were true..."] = true,
["This room pulses with energy, but feels unlike any we have seen so far."] = true,
["A thousand years ago, the night elves and the dragons fought against the qiraji and their Old God master."] = true,
["Ah, the ancient Vaults of the Kings of Mogu'shan. What might this button do...?"] = true,
["I've heard tales of this one: Subetai the Swift, well known as a masterful archer and genius thief. He stole from the rich, and kept everything for himself."] = true,
["When the Scarab Gong rang, that wave came crashing down. Qiraji forces poured out of their prison, but the Might of Kalimdor kept them contained."] = true,
["Yes! Please let us pass!"] = true,
["A wise lesson indeed. Now...I believe I have many stories to learn."] = true,
["The door mechanism seems to have activated with the demise of the guardians. I fear what we may find within."] = true,
["This seems to be a terminal controlling the device. Let's see here..."] = true,
["May the great crane guide your steps."] = true,
["This is not the last we have seen of Feng..."] = true,
["Heroes! You're alive. I brought help."] = true,
["You must destroy it. Here, now, before any harm can come to Pandaria."] = true,
["What is this? I've heard nothing of this emperor. Meng the Demented? According to these texts, Meng was the most foul and maniacal ruler to ever abuse the imperial throne."] = true,
["Many young Pandaren warriors have vanished into this...tomb. Have your wits about you."] = true,
["The large Quilen seem to be guarding that door. Tread carefully, lest you wake them."] = true,
["Taran Zhu!"] = true,
["Who here fought at the Scarab Wall?"] = true,
["It must have been hidden away long before recorded history.  And with good reason!"] = true,
["An endless army of soulless abominations...I shudder to think of the violence that would erupt from such a machine."] = true,
["This looks to be the record of Qiang the Merciless, a great conqueror who ruled his vassals with an iron fist!"] = true,
["I will stay behind and investigate this dais further..."] = true,
["A secret passage has opened beneath the platform, this way!"] = true,
["Fascinating, I have never heard tales of anything like this. The mogu hide their secrets well."] = true,
["Yes! The journey of Shen-zin Su was merely a beloved tale. To think I have witnessed his return to Pandaria... I do not know how to feel."] = true,
["But this evil could not be defeated. So the dragons sealed it away."] = true,
["They call to me, the discs...I must..."] = true,
},
},
["Name"] = {
["enUS"] = "Lorewalker Cho",
},
},
