["Once again you have impressed me, $PLAYER_NAME$. Without your aid, we would have not made it this far. Walk with me..."] = true,
["The Horde has many rivals in this world. Some call us enemies... others call us outcasts. But we find strength in unity... and in defiance of those who would challenge our freedom."] = true,
