["Ye won't hit us with that one!"] = true,
["%s interrupts Kobold Mystic."] = true,
["Here's your take of the spoils!"] = true,
["All right, let's do this! Through here!"] = true,
["We can get around by jumping on those big mushrooms."] = true,
["Let's rescue these folks and avoid these webs."] = true,
["Freshly mined!"] = true,
["Time tae push deeper in. There's bound tae be a few kobold leaders below making a mess of this place."] = true,
["They're behind us! Watch out!"] = true,
["I'm not about tae leave the Isle of Dorn unexplored! I have a reputation tae uphold."] = true,
["That's everyone here. Let's keep this cart movin'!"] = true,
["No sense waitin' for Xal'atath to make the next move, eh? Let me know when yer ready to get tae work."] = true,
["There's treasure close by."] = true,
["Catch of the day!"] = true,
["Where's the fun in that? Come on! Let's get some practical experience with the kobolds."] = true,
["%s begins herb gathering."] = true,
["You're here! Some members of the League are below. Up for a bit o' a challenge?"] = true,
["And let's be quick. This place gives me the willies..."] = true,
["Ah... Well, I'll be in a heap of trouble for this one sounds like."] = true,
["Don't step in those webs! Nerubians might pop out if ye do."] = true,
["Grab one of those enchanted candles tae stay safe from these shadows."] = true,
["Here's your next lesson, Dagran. You've got tae think on your feet when you're an adventurer. No hidin' behind books!"] = true,
["Nothing ol' Brann can't get through."] = true,
