["To this day, Anasterian is revered by both blood elves and high elves. He is a symbol of when our people stood as one."] = true,
["After Anasterian's sacrifice, our people were split apart. The blood elves stayed in the ruins to rebuild, and did terrible things to regain that feeling of power."] = true,
["The Silver Covenant returns to Silvermoon, one last time."] = true,
["We have also done terrible things since then."] = true,
["Aethas, I am not here to fight you. We are here to defend the city of our birth from the Void."] = true,
