["It's over..."] = true,
["Turalyon, I've started my assault on the northern front. I'll keep their forces occupied so you can hit the priority targets."] = true,
["An entity from the Void has emerged into our world. It must not be allowed to spread its corruption."] = true,
["The voices are louder now. More insistent. But they do not control me."] = true,
["How did a being of the Light become a creature of Shadow?"] = true,
["Figure out their motives... and put a stop to their efforts."] = true,
["She... must be... stopped."] = true,
["The Shadowguard is building up its presence near the temple."] = true,
["Senn! Do not let the Light claim you!"] = true,
["Come, through the portal."] = true,
["My vision has never been clearer Lothraxion, but I don't want to believe it. "] = true,
["Make haste. We should have the Mantle before Terminas returns to his citadel."] = true,
["It seems my training is complete."] = true,
["The way is open! Hurry, heroes!"] = true,
["I feel the fallen naaru's power. It... beckons me."] = true,
["She's the one who needs to be careful. I will turn the Void itself against her."] = true,
["Such chaos... such anguish. I have never sensed anything like it before."] = true,
["I sense great despair emanating from within. L'ura..."] = true,
["The beast has been defeated. Well done, champions."] = true,
["I will silence you once and for all!"] = true,
["You want to see my true strength? I'll show it to you firsthand."] = true,
["Without that doubt, the faithful becomes the fanatic."] = true,
["You will not be fighting alone, Turalyon. The demons will pay for every step... with their blood."] = true,
["Farewell, old friend..."] = true,
["This is no time to go off on your own!"] = true,
