["enUS"] = {
["If we use the Surian theory, then yes, but not if we go with the Y'serian approach."] = true,
["Wouldn't that cause the weave to unravel if not properly anchored before starting the casting?"] = true,
["Only if we didn't follow the proper initialization procedures."] = true,
["At least we wouldn't be around to have to clean it up."] = true,
["If we reverse the Essence flows perhaps we can alter the polarity."] = true,
["What if we used three focuses in Tyrean pattern? That should solve it."] = true,
["The resultant energies could collapse though, and that could cause an energy flux that would give you a migraine for weeks."] = true,
["But wouldn't that mean crossing the streams? Isn't that really bad?"] = true,
["That will unbalance the magical focus, though, and cause a reverse vibration in the ether."] = true,
["But what if the resulting frequency shift were to send magical feedback up the flows?"] = true,
["The portal will shift slightly, at this point if you cast a binding cantrip you will solidify it in place."] = true,
["Putting in twelve centers of focus might allow the magical energies to form more solidly, adding the necessary stability."] = true,
["I suppose that could work, if we had twenty people to cast it with."] = true,
["If we use the appropriate sequence we should be ok. Will just take some serious studying before we start."] = true,
["Always so negative. The chances of that happening are between zero and none."] = true,
["Why can't we just shift the array to compensate for the variance in the flux?"] = true,
["The magical wards at that point should be supported enough by the energy flux to contain the entity."] = true,
["Wow, all of this for a love potion. Hope he's worth it."] = true,
["When the positively aligned energies collide with the negatively charged energies, they don't negate one another."] = true,
["But if we stabilize it with an anchor thread at the appropriate energy crux then it should work."] = true,
["So then the array of magics would cascade into a chain reaction of positively charged energies."] = true,
["I think not, I don't need to be blown up again."] = true,
["Maginor says that twisting alternating flows of positive energy actually creates a much more stable flow."] = true,
