["The Sunwell corrupted! The Vanguard swept away as if they were nothing! How will we survive this?"] = true,
["Champion, place these tokens on any survivors you find. They will allow my Magisters to teleport them to safety."] = true,
["You have much to learn, but that was a surprisingly good showing."] = true,
