["I know when we first met dat I was not kind to you."] = true,
["You even stood up to your own king for my people, knowin' his prejudice after you swallowed your own."] = true,
["We're not gonna make it easy for dem either."] = true,
["Liadrin, my hash'ura. Before we face Kith'ix, I have somethin' to say I should have said long ago."] = true,
["I did not want your help or your meddlin'. I begrudged you the title of hash'ura though I barely knew what de title meant."] = true,
["Are... are you sure?"] = true,
["But even when I bared my tusks at you, you showed me kindness and understandin'. And you didn't need to."] = true,
["It must have been fate dat the loa brought you to me, hash'ura. And no one deserves dat title more."] = true,
